<title>INDIA: FOREIGN INVESTMENT IN INDIAN DEBT AT $105.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>FOREIGN INVESTMENT IN INDIAN DEBT AT $105.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total foreign investment in Indian debt is $105.2 million, the head of capital market regulating body said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The total foreign investment in Indian debt is $105.2 million,&quot; D.R. Mehta, chairman of the Securities and Exchange Board of India told reporters.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91)-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
